A '''Base Barrier''' is a mechanic that protects enemy bases in certain stages. It was added in [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]] and first introduced in [[Anniversary/11 1/2 Year#Disaster in the Wan Wan Kingdom|Disaster in the Wan Wan Kingdom]].
[[File:BaseBarrier.gif|thumb|right|A Base Barrier protecting an enemy base in [[Be Bee Queen (Merciless)|Be Bee Queen]]]]

==Explanation==
A Base Barrier is a green, rhombus-shaped crystal that renders the enemy base completely invulnerable until the stage's designated boss enemy has been defeated, effectively preventing players from [[Cheese|cheesing]] the stage by skipping the boss. If the boss has not spawned yet and spawns on a timer, the Base Barrier will be present beforehand; otherwise, it will be absent until the base takes enough damage to spawn the linked boss.

Base Barriers do not have health and are entirely separate from [[Barrier]]s and [[Shield]]s, meaning [[:Category:Barrier Breaker Cats|Barrier Breakers]], the [[Ototo Corps#Breakerblast|Breakerblast Cannon]] and [[:Category:Shield Piercing Cats|Shield Piercers]] have no effect against them.

Base Barriers are normally invisible, but briefly flash whenever the base is attacked. When a Base Barrier's linked boss is defeated, it will shatter like a Barrier hit by a Barrier Breaker attack.

For a list of all stages Base Barriers appear in, see the [[:Category:Stages with Base Barriers|Stages with Base Barriers]] category.

