==Trivia==
*In [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]], the first stage to have a Base Barrier was [[Impending Calamity]], but in other versions, the first was [[Professional Babbler (Merciless)|Professional Babbler]].
*[[The Face of God/Invasion|The Face of God Invasion]] and [[Revival of Origin/Invasion|Revival of Origin Invasion]] are the first non-event stages and only [[Uncanny Legends]] stages to have Base Barriers.
*Sprites for Base Barriers were added in [[Version 13.2 Update|Version 13.2]], but were unimplemented until [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]].

